From c51d4a0287541a71270254f0fff8e4d4951c9d6c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 17:41:36 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 5/9] Access 9.2 A-5: the judged use in the needs core

npc-work.js (the verdict, reach, wakeOn); in npc-needs.js the failed turn-back
that parks itself, the dead station's counted off park, the desk filter for a
judged need, failure parks that wake only by their own cause (and for a set
mapping or a magnet, R5 n4), the re-arm mark, the outage kick, the failure
pools and pictures, check visits, frustration answers and the reload's held
park (its hold less the time since the response, R5 n3), and in the adapter
desk, useVerdict, reportUse, workRules and cellBeside. The turn-back table
test lists the new failed row.
